                    <task type="Show Message Box" id="2" taskOnFail="false" >
                        <data value="The Dark Lord" name="journalEntryTitle" />
                        <data value="&quot;Lando Calrissian, accompanied by his aide, Lobot, stands upon the landing pad. A group of Wing Guard Officers stand at attention a fair distance behind the two men. An Imperial Lambda-class Shuttle descends from the heavens and touches down on the landing pad. Calrissian and Lobot share a meaningful look then Calrissian strides forward to stand a short distance away from the bottom of the ramp. The ramp of the shuttle descends and a squad of Stormtroopers emergetheir armour gleaming in the orange glow of Bespin's primary. They take up formation to either side of the shuttle's ramp. Moments later, the bounty hunter Boba Fett emerges from the shuttle. He stares at Calrissian for a moment or two, before stepping aside to allow the next passenger from the shuttle to exit. Darth Vader, Dark Lord of the Sith and Supreme Commander of Imperial Forces, descends from the shuttle. Vader strides forward to stand directly in front of Calrissian. &quot;" name="journalEntryDescription" />
